WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.067
REPORTER: Could I ask you first,
your Royal Highness,

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.002
what was
your instant impression?

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:06.205
I remember thinking
what a very jolly, and amusing,

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:09.141
and-- and attractive 16-year-old
she was.

00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:11.110
I don't know
what you thought of me, but...

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.646
-Pretty amazing. (CHUCKLES)
-(LAUGHS)

00:00:13.746 --> 00:00:17.216
♪ (SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:18.351
SPEAKER:<i> Sweet, kind...</i>

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:20.219
SPEAKER 2:<i> The princess has been
 the best thing to happen</i>

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.754
<i> to the monarchy in centuries.</i>

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:24.290
-REPORTER 2:
Did you get a chance to see her?
